{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Winner of Best Puzzle Game &amp; Best Storytelling @ Game Connection America 2024</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>heartfelt story</strong> of friendship, told through the pages of a <strong>beautifully illustrated scrapbook</strong>. Every page offers a <strong>brand new challenge</strong>. <strong>Sort </strong>items, <strong>solve</strong> gentle puzzles, <strong>decorate</strong> the scrapbook, and <strong>see the story unfold</strong> piece by piece.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/2cf44bf5f4a01bfa4c00eea5de168496.webp?t=1761217569\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/2cf44bf5f4a01bfa4c00eea5de168496.poster.avif?t=1761217569\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=285 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Connie, a shy ten-year-old, uprooted to the city and feeling lost and alone. Just as she\u2019s at her lowest, a new friend comes into the picture - bold, confident Beth! From that day forward, the two become inseparable.\u00a0Now, years later, Connie revisits their friendship through the pages of her scrapbook. <strong>Is it time to reach out\u2026 or is the past best left behind?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/13954b789961179f84d0224a1589b557.webp?t=1761217569\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/13954b789961179f84d0224a1589b557.poster.avif?t=1761217569\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=538 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy, <strong>relaxing scrapbooking</strong> activities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique puzzles</strong> on every page</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful artwork</strong> that brings memories to life\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartfelt, <strong>authentic story</strong> of friendship told across years\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get creative with <strong>cute and charming stickers</strong> to collect\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/4f6167dc1855e2b071035fdfa2a85536.poster.avif?t=1761217569\" width=1170 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/4f6167dc1855e2b071035fdfa2a85536.webm?t=1761217569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u> Quotes</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;It\u2019s sweet, and a little sad in all the right places, whilst providing just enough challenge.&quot;</i>  <strong>- The Escape Room Gamer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A beautiful story-driven game with a cosy vibe but heart-breaking undertones.&quot;</i><strong>  </strong>  <strong>- The Gamer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cI nearly cried the whole way through...The game is so tender and vulnerable. Pure gold.\u201d </i><strong>- Player feedback</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2891370?t=1761217569","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2891370?t=1761217569","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/23265af3c5b0dc2a67fb18eb1cc9e3faad26a